You could not find the Sharp Blades of the Insane Crios?

The blades are very important. They are made of a rare metal that does not exist on the surface. It is ideal for making a censer that can withstand enough power to burn the tentacle and extract the substance it produces.
This may be the key to defeating Midranda.

Please, hunt the Insane Crios and collect 3 Sharp Blades.
